# NOTE — This file is kept for future use only.
#
# Right now, Donum does NOT need any .env file. All required values are
# already committed inside the private repo:
#
#   - SUPABASE_URL + SUPABASE_ANON_KEY  →  src/lib/env.ts
#   - Google Maps API key               →  android/app/src/main/AndroidManifest.xml
#
# When you clone the repo you have everything you need to run.
#
# If we ever move secrets to .env (e.g. if the repo goes public), the
# format will look like this:
#
# SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR_PROJECT.supabase.co
# SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJhbGciOi...
# GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=AIza...
#
# Mapbox was removed in early 2026 — we use Google Maps via
# react-native-maps now. Ignore any references to Mapbox tokens.
